# Cursor / Agent Rules for this repo

## General
- Prefer incremental changes and frequent commits.
- Keep compatibility with Rust 1.82 / Cargo 1.82 (avoid crates requiring newer editions).
- Run `cargo build` after changes to core runtime/parser/cli.

## Language core
- Maintain backwards compatibility with slang keywords (Ayo/Yoo/Bruh/Maybe/etc).
- When adding JS-like syntax, keep it as aliases rather than breaking existing syntax.
- Favor clear errors with filename/line/col.

## Code quality
- Fix compiler warnings you introduce.
- Avoid long-lived commands/processes in automation.

